  "Name": "TestLink v1.9.3 Arbitrary File Upload Vulnerability",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability in TestLink version 1.9.3 or prior. This application has an upload feature that allows any authenticated user to upload arbitrary files to the '/upload_area/nodes_hierarchy/' directory with a randomized file name. The file name can be retrieved from the database using SQL injection.",
